The Synchronizes are provided by the java.util.concurrent package.

It controls flow of threads, ensuring proper synchronization and collaboration

It is supported by Semaphore, CountDownLatch, CyclicBarrier, Exchanger and Phaser.

Why is AtomicInteger faster than synchronized?
